# V2-11 Australopithecus on the huge planet of seed 7, in the African savanna of the V2-10 shots
# (`x=`, `z=`): a group placed close (a mother and her young, a male walking, one at work, one
# feeding) in a patch cleared of the tall plants; then a group of the population sought and drawn
# out as the game draws them, living half a minute of its morning about its site under a nut
# tree; and at dusk up in the trees, nesting.
# `hearth --screenshot-list tools/shots/v211_hominins.shots`
